      "document": {
        "id": "bc2985c6-3401-4049-8b73-646047ac2256",
        "title": "Opus 5 crushed Fable 5 at 3D des",
        "status": "draft",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "2080760629653102958",
            "relation": "root",
            "depth": 0,
            "sourceTweetId": "2080760629653102958",
            "author": {
              "name": "atomic.chat",
              "handle": "atomic_chat_hq",
              "avatarUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037454994899959808/L7uqgUfL_normal.jpg",
              "isVerified": false
            },
            "content": "Opus 5 crushed Fable 5 at 3D destruction physics for 2x cheaper!\n\nWe gave four models the same task: build three self-contained HTML scenes with real physics\n\nPrompts:\n- A tornado that sucks in a whole field\n- A wrecking ball taking down an apartment block\n- An overloaded truck collapsing a truss bridge\n\nOutputs:\n- Opus 5: 55.9K tokens, $1.40\n- Fable 5: 55.1K tokens, $2.82\n- Kimi K3: 35.7K tokens, $0.55\n- GPT 5.6: 20.1K tokens, $0.31\n\nOpus got all three right unlike the other models. Houses fly up the funnel and out the top, the wall breaks where the ball hits and the rubble piles up, the bridge drops the truck into the river. Fable had almost nothing on the ground for the tornado to pick up, its building collapsed on its own before the ball even touched it and its bridge blew into sticks all at once. GPT is the cheapest here but its ball never reached the building at all and its bridge fell apart in a way nothing falls apart in real life. Kimi K3, the new Chinese frontier model, ended up in the same place as GPT",
            "createdAt": "Fri Jul 24 21:02:47 +0000 2026",
            "viewCount": 95869,
            "metrics": {
              "views": 95869,
              "likes": 545,
              "retweets": 43,
              "replies": 18,
              "quotes": 14,
              "bookmarks": 205
            },
            "media": [
              "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2080760395166257153/img/DkPLPgWYiNh7xxZy.jpg"
            ],
            "translation": {
              "provider": "google",
              "status": "success",
              "language": "zh-CN",
              "text": "Opus 5 在 3D 破坏物理方面击败了《神鬼寓言 5》，价格便宜了 2 倍！\n\n我们给四个模型分配了相同的任务：构建三个具有真实物理特性的独立 HTML 场景\n\n提示：\n- 一场龙卷风吞噬了整个田野\n- 一个破坏球摧毁了一座公寓楼\n- 一辆超载的卡车压垮了一座桁架桥\n\n输出：\n- Opus 5：55.9K 代币，1.40 美元\n- 《神鬼寓言 5》：55.1K 代币，2.82 美元\n- Kimi K3：35.7K 代币，0.55 美元\n- GPT 5.6：20.1K 代币，0.31 美元\n\n与其他型号不同，Opus 的三项都正确。房屋飞上漏斗并从顶部飞出，球击中的地方墙壁破裂，瓦砾堆积起来，桥梁将卡车扔进河里。 《神鬼寓言》地面上几乎没有任何东西可以被龙卷风卷起，它的建筑在球接触到它之前就自行倒塌了，它的桥也一下子被吹成了木棍。 GPT 是这里最便宜的，但它的球根本没有到达建筑物，而且它的桥以现实生活中没有任何东西会崩溃的方式崩溃了。中国新前沿车型Kimi K3最终与GPT同名",
